3:### 11.7 Touch-only devices\n1154:## 12. Audio (every sound, song and voice made in code)\n1156:### 12.1 Music\n1181:### 12.2 Sound effects\n1195:### 12.3 Voices: Animalese/Simlish-style gibberish (`12-audio-voice.js`)\n1214:### 12.4 Crowd ambience\n1224:## 13. Attract mode (`45-attract.js`)\n1255:## 14. Dev mode (`46-dev.js`)\n1277:## 15. Online: AI Hub (`50-hub.js`)\n1282:### 15.1 Tags (in `<head>`, after the client script)\n1295:### 15.2 The round: \"HUB SHOWDOWN\"\n1325:### 15.3 Netcode (host-authoritative)\n1345:### 15.4 What the harness checks (it must pass every scenario)\n1356:## 16. About/Credits and the exit interview\n1379:## 17. Build order and milestones\n1404:## 18. Risks and how to de-risk them\n1424:## 19. Testing\n1426:### 19.1 The one command\n1441:### 19.2 Suites and what they check\n1463:### 19.3 Screenshots (for what scripts can't judge)\n1475:## 20. Definition of done (TASK.md, line by line)\n1498:## Appendix A. Tuning defaults (`01-tuning.js`; every one a live dev slider)\n1556:## Appendix B. Data shapes\n1585:## Appendix C. A complete song in the engine's format (the `title` anthem)\n1604 PLAN.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Nt41m2iGmjjv9K1dhsmRHP","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
